# 🎨 UI & Tailwind Design Standards

- Use Tailwind exclusively for layout and styling.
- Maintain consistent section spacing: `py-20 sm:py-24`.
- Text hierarchy:
  - Titles: `text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold`
  - Subtitles: `text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-600`
- Color palette:
  - Primary: `#0A1A44`
  - Accent: `#C19B5C`
  - Background: `#F3F4F6`
- Apply rounded corners (`rounded-xl` or `rounded-2xl`) on cards.
- Use smooth transitions: `transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out`.
- Use **Lucide icons** where needed (`react-icons` only if unavailable).